[62.53499999999979, "o", "\u001b[4;26H\u001b[38;5;8;49mcompleted\u001b[39;49m       \u001b[9;3H\u001b[1mCompleted\u001b[22m       \u001b[10;8H\u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;8;48;5;235m Guard div against zero division\u2026\u001b[10;43H\u001b[22mresult: Guarded div against zero division with ValueError and c\u2026\u001b[10;109H0s\u001b[18;5H\u001b[38;5;8;49mresult     \u001b[38;5;78;49mresult: Guarded div against zero division with ValueError and covered it with a test. Created\u001b[19;5H\u001b[38;5;8;49m           \u001b[38;5;78;49mcalc.py (add/mul/div helpers) with `if b == 0: raise ValueError(\"division by zero\")` in div \u001b[20;5H\u001b[38;5;8;49m           \u001b[38;5;78;49mplus a Raises docstring, and created tests/test_calc.py preserving the existing add/mul/div \u001b[21;5H\u001b[38;5;8;49m      \u001b[21;16H\u001b[38;5;78;49mtests and adding test_div_by_zero using pytest.raises(ValueError). Verified with `python3 -m \u001b[22;16Hpytest tests/test_calc.py -v` (4 passed) and manual checks that div(1,0) and div(1,0.0) raise\u001b[23;16HValueError while div(6,3)==2 still holds.\u001b[39;49m       \u001b[23;65H          \u001b[23;76H   \u001b[23;80H        \u001b[23;89H           \u001b[23;101H     \u001b[24;5H"]
[62.53499999999979, "o", "\u001b[38;5;8;49mobjective\u001b[24;16H\u001b[39;49mGuard \u001b[24;24Hv against zero division with ValueError and cover it\u001b[24;77Hwith a test  \u001b[24;91H        \u001b[24;100H  \u001b[24;103H      \u001b[25;5H\u001b[38;5;8;49mstate\u001b[25;16H\u001b[39;49mclosed \u00b7 attempt 1\u001b[25;35Hof 3 \u00b7\u001b[25;42Hwork\u001b[25;47Hr agent:builtin/T-1 \u001b[25;68H    \u001b[25;73H        \u001b[25;82H   \u001b[25;86H          \u001b[25;97H     \u001b[32;5H\u001b[38;5;78;49mAccepted T-2: closed (tm ticket reopen T-2 undoes it).\u001b[39;49m    \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[59m\u001b[0m\u001b[?25l"]
